#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0581 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: None of TRTP, TRTPGy, TRTA, and TRTAGy are present and none of the character treatment variables in ADSL defined in the IG are present
#note "Only ACTARM is present -> a treatment variable exists, no violation. No member of the eight indexed families is present, so the rule executes; it would report this dataset if the Check did not test ACTARM."
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL type=Num
col ACTARM type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALT | 12.5 | X
---
